 Ephemeris is a planner and note-taking application focused on e-ink
 devices with pens (e.g. PineNote). It manages profiles, calendars,
 tasks, and handwritten notes.
 .
 This package bundles whisper-cli for on-device voice transcription
 (model downloaded from Settings). Handwriting OCR uses the system
 Tesseract packages listed under Depends.

